{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:01.30](Hahaha)\n[00:03.52]Woah, woah, woah, woah\n[00:05.92]Woah, woah, woah, woah, woah\n[00:08.26]Woah, woah, woah, woah, woah\n[00:10.66]Skrrt\n[Chorus]\n[00:12.72]Same way she come (Same way)\n[00:14.96]Same way she leave, yeah (Yeah, the same damn way)\n[00:18.98]All women scum (Oh)\n[00:20.60]Get the fuck away from me, yeah (Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[00:24.46]I was blinded by love (I was blind)\n[00:26.60]But now I can see, yeah (I can see, I can see, uh-huh)\n[00:30.38]You ain't never made me happy (No, no)\n[00:32.70]You just made me believe, yeah (Uh-huh, oh)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:36.76]Realest shit I ever spoke, spoke, spoke (Yeah)\n[00:39.74]Realest shit I never wrote, wrote, wrote (Yeah)\n[00:42.34]Mixed the Perky with the Four Loko, woah (Yeah)\n[00:45.36]You're not supposed to mixed the liquor with the narcos (Yeah)\n[00:48.72]Damn, that's to numb the pain from these\n[00:51.60]Scandalous bitches in my brain, I mean (Yeah, yeah)\n[00:54.78]All girls seem to be the same, I mean (Yeah, yeah)\n[00:58.00]Your girl still gon' give me brain, I mean\n[01:06.02]Phew-phew-phew, let the wind blow her out my life (Be gone)\n[01:27.28]Anything romantic turns to suicide, suicide (Yeah)\n[01:41.62]Phew, huh, let the wind blow her out my life (Be gone)\n[01:48.78]Anything romantic turn to suicide, suicide (Yeah)\n[Chorus]\n[01:52.84]Same way she come (Same way)\n[01:55.10]Same way she leave, yeah (Yeah, the same damn way)\n[02:06.40]All women scum (Oh)\n[02:09.00]Get the fuck away from me, yeah (Uh-huh, uh-huh, uh-huh)\n[02:21.84]I was blinded by love (I was blind)\n[02:26.62]But now I can see, yeah (I can see, I can see, uh-huh)\n[02:30.38]You ain't never made me happy (No, no)\n[02:32.62]You just made me believe, yeah (Uh-huh, oh)\n[Verse 2]\n[02:41.78]You make me believe (Sad), love ain't meant for me (Yeah)\n[02:53.46]This is crazy (Yeah), this insanity (Yeah)\n[02:59.58]Thought you was my lady, now you hate me\n[03:17.38]Still got the blueprint